			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766580101,
					"content": "妳好啊，茜涅特，上次找回來的機器人也都調整好了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580102,
					"content": "#嗯，多虧了{F#妳}{M#你}們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜涅特"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580103,
					"content": "說起來，我們的確有些新的發現呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580104,
					"content": "真的？請講給我聽！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜涅特"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580105,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}和派蒙向茜涅特講述了不久前的見聞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766580106,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們描述的那種表現…這些機器人似乎很喜歡你們，並向{F#妳}{M#你}們發出了「一起玩耍」的邀請。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜涅特"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580107,
					"content": "真的？好有趣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580108,
					"content": "嗯…果然是這樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜涅特"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580109,
					"content": "茜涅特，又發現什麼了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580110,
					"content": "我現在能確定了，我的創意要透過機器人之間的互動來實現，找回的機器人越多，就越接近最初的設想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜涅特"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580111,
					"content": "現在它們已經擁有了和他人交流的能力，只要把剩下的機器人也找齊…我的創意還是行得通的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜涅特"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580112,
					"content": "哇，興奮起來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580113,
					"content": "#啊，不好意思，說起來還是要仰仗{F#妳}{M#你}們，下一片區域也在地圖上標好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766580114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜涅特"
				},
				{
					"id": 766580114,
					"content": "那我們盡快出發吧，我開始好奇這些機器人最終會變成什麼樣子了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
